#: scenario6:scenario6_DB08BB38_A638_4FA0_A996_6B4CFF26E22A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59dd69d3074dc8456ce86fc5541ee42b59102037963b32ccc6632130edbc1048
